  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">皆さんこんにちは！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">鳥取県出身</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">高校</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">年生</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;16</span><span class=\"s1\">歳</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">山口陽世（やまぐちはるよ）です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_6081.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-04-20/33432_0.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s1\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">少し前に佐々木美玲さんがブログにツーショットを載せてくださりました！</span><span class=\"s2\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ありがとうございます</span><span class=\"s2\">&lt;(_ _)&gt;</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">同じ写真ですけど載させていただきます。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_6013.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-04-20/33432_1.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">嬉しすぎて、笑っていますね。</span><span class=\"s2\">(o´</span><span class=\"s1\">罒</span><span class=\"s2\">`o)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s1\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">そういえば、</span><span class=\"s2\">4</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">17</span><span class=\"s1\">日が欅坂</span><span class=\"s2\">46</span><span class=\"s1\">二期生さんの遠藤光莉ちゃんのお誕生日で</span><span class=\"s2\">4</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">18</span><span class=\"s1\">日が大園玲さんのお誕生日でしたね〜！！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">おめでとうございます</span><span class=\"s4\">🎉</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">研修生として一緒に頑張ってきた</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">人なのでこれからもお互い頑張りたいです！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">また</span><span class=\"s2\">15</span><span class=\"s1\">人みんなで会いたいです</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s5\">≧</span><span class=\"s2\">▽</span><span class=\"s5\">≦</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s1\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まりぃちゃんとのツーショットです</span><span class=\"s4\">✌🏻️</span><span class=\"s2\">'ω'</span><span class=\"s4\">✌🏻️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">右がまりぃちゃんで左が私（はるよ）です</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">初めて自分たちの日向坂</span><span class=\"s2\">46</span><span class=\"s1\">の制服を着させていただいた時です！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_6059.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-04-20/33432_2.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まりぃちゃんは生年月日が同じなんです！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">みくにちゃんのブログにもあったのですが、電話でイントロクイズを最初は</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">人でしていたんです。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">人ともテンション上がりすぎて何を言ってるのかわからない状態になっていました</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">一緒に話してると楽しすぎるんですよ</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s6\" style=\"font-family: Menlo-Regular;\">◜ᴗ◝</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;)</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">雰囲気は、ほわ〜っとしてておとなしそうなんですけど面白い人です</span><span class=\"s2\">(*´</span><span class=\"s1\">艸</span><span class=\"s2\">`*)</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ブログチェックしてない方は見てみてくださいね</span><span class=\"s2\">(^o^)o</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img alt=\"IMG_6061.png\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-04-20/33432_3.png\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">すごい笑ってる。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">絶対この時まりぃちゃんが横にいました笑</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s1\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">次はオーディション受けた理由などなどお話をしたいなと思っています！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">明日はみくにちゃんです</span><span class=\"s4\">🌈</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">次の次辺りにみくにちゃんについてのお話もしようかな</span><span class=\"s4\">😏</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">最後まで読んで下さりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s4\">🐷</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">山口陽世でした</span><span class=\"s4\">👋🏻</span></p></div></div>\n                    ",
